# Libraries (`lib`)

The `lib` directory is reserved for **local or custom reusable libraries** used by the AutoLink RadioSense firmware.

Libraries placed in this directory are intended to provide functionality that can be reused by multiple parts of the project without being tightly coupled to a specific application subsystem.

This directory should not normally be used for the project's main application logic. Subsystem implementations should remain within `src`.

External libraries obtained through PlatformIO's library manager should normally be declared as dependencies in `platformio.ini` rather than manually placed in this directory.

Custom libraries may be added here when they provide reusable functionality that is appropriate to isolate from the main application source code.
